# Script Rules

## Shared Scripts

Reusable scripts go in `/scripts` (e.g. `build-app.ts`, `generate-icons.ts`).

## Local Scripts

Temporary or machine-only scripts go in `/local-scripts` (gitignored).

## Naming

- kebab-case, descriptive names (e.g. `reset-local-db.ts`, `local-api-test.ts`).
